~ start
if not PlayerStats.in_photo
	match PlayerStats.scene_progress
		when 0
			if not PlayerStats.has_food1
				Max: Oh, some Dried Mangoes, Mom's favorite!
				Max: I'll grab some of these before going home.
				$> PlayerStats.has_food1 = true
			else
				Max: Nothing much here.
		when 2
			Max: I've already gathered enough pasalubong.
else
	Max: I can't exactly grab anything from the past.

=> END